Authentication Full Flow Diagram

Client → Controller → login()

→ UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken → AuthenticationManager → ProviderManager → DaoAuthenticationProvider
→ UserDetailsService → Database (fetch user) → PasswordEncoder (verify)

✔ If success:
   → Authenticated Authentication object

→ Generate JWT
→ Return response


